<title>JAPAN: NAMURA SHIPBUILDING TO BECOME TOP ORII SHAREHOLDER.</title>
<headline>NAMURA SHIPBUILDING TO BECOME TOP ORII SHAREHOLDER.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese robot maker Orii Corp said on Friday that Namura Shipbuilding Co Ltd would become its largest shareholder with a 30.74 percent stake on August 14.</p>
<p>Namura Shipbuilding has completed the purchase of Orii shares held by Orii Chairman Masaru Orii on August 7, Orii said in a statement.</p>
</text>
